  "description": {
   "en": "A collection of 4 stories:\n\nTempting Kiss\nA smart girl tries to confess to the guy she likes, only to overhear him making fun of her. Years later she's given up on guys, but a hot bad boy wants to catch her eye.\n\nWet After School\nFujimori Shiho is a teacher with a troublesome student. Takeru Kagura needs supplementary lessons, but he has his own ideas about what \"Shiho-chan\" can teach him, and what he can teach her!\n\nMaking Feelings\nMidori has been dating her boyfriend for two months, but sex still hurts! Talking to her girlfriends about it, she realizes the guy behind her is Asagi-san, her demon work supervisor and he heard the whole thing!\n\nJealousy (Scandalous)"
  },
